Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|Dynamic Data Lists,Workflow,Forms|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given these variables
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
##########################################################
The Poshi if element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	Then User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Submit Published Form With Text Field
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form edit Description
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Text Field|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Settings
	And Form configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
	And Form save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Edit Form By Name
	And Form publish Form
	And FormsAdminNavigator open Publish URL
		|publishFormURL|${publishedFormPublicURL}|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|TextField|
		|fieldValue|Text Field Value|
	And Button click Submit For Publication
	And Alert view Success Message
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto View Entries
	And WorkflowAsset view Form Entry Table
		|fieldLabel|Text Field|
		|fieldValue|Text Field Value|
		|workflowStatus|Pending|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Details
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Form Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow view Task Assigned To Me
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Form Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow view Task Assigned To Me Details
		|workflowAssetContent|Text|
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Form Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow view Completed Task
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Form Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto View Entries
	Then WorkflowAsset view Form Entry Table
		|fieldLabel|Text Field|
		|fieldValue|Text Field Value|
		|workflowStatus|Approved|
Scenario: View Date Asset Details
Priority: 5
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form edit Description
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Date|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Date|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Edit
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Settings
	And Form configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
	And Form save
	And Page add
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|pageName|Form Page|
		|portletName|Form|
	And FormPortletNavigator goto Select Form
	And FormPortletConfiguration select Form
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Form Page|
	And FormFields view Date Label
		|fieldLabel|Date|
		|fieldName|Date|
	And FormFields edit Date
		|fieldLabel|Date|
		|fieldName|Date|
		|fieldValue|02/01/2016|
	And Button click Submit For Publication
	And Alert view Success Message
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Details
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Form Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow view Task Assigned To Me
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Form Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow view Task Assigned To Me Details
		|workflowAssetContent|Date|
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Workflow goto Preview View
	And FormFields view Date Field
		|fieldLabel|Date|
		|fieldName|Date|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Form Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	Then Workflow view Completed Task
		|workflowAssetTitle|Created Form Name|
		|workflowAssetType|Form Record|
		|workflowTask|Review|
